  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3305.02 Grounds for Revocation or Suspension. After a hearing, an agency’s approval shall be revoked or suspended for the following:\n\n(a) The approval was issued on the basis of incorrect information;\n\n(b) The approval was issued in violation of these rules;\n\n(c) The agency refuses to comply with applicable statutes or rules; or\n\n(d) The agency has failed to comply with a notice of violation and order to correct.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98;ss by #8741, INTERIM, eff 11-18-06, EXPIRED: 5-17-07\n\nNew. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3300.html"
